 ## Scope and Limitations
 
-- Only `.xlsx` is supported as the spreadsheet file format for load and save.
-- The library stores formulas but does not include a formula calculation engine.
-- PDF export is supported, but there is no general HTML export or image export API.
-- Macros, VBA, and pivot tables are outside the supported public API surface.
-- Broader format coverage and richer spreadsheet features belong to the commercial Aspose.Cells product line.
+Aspose.Cells FOSS for .NET reads and writes the .xlsx spreadsheet file format and exports to PDF, supporting basic cell content, styling, and formula storage without a calculation engine.
+
+- The library supports only .xlsx for load and save operations, and the install command is dotnet add package `Aspose.Cells.FOSS`.
+- The library stores formulas but does not include a formula calculation engine, and PDF export is supported but there is no general HTML export or image export API.
+- Macros, VBA, and pivot tables are outside the supported public API surface, and the install command is dotnet add package `Aspose.Cells.FOSS`.
+- Broader format coverage and richer spreadsheet features belong to the commercial Aspose.Cells product line, and the install command is dotnet add package `Aspose.Cells.FOSS`.
+
+These limitations don't apply to [full-featured Aspose.Cells for .NET — Enterprise Edition](https://products.aspose.com/cells/net/). It adds advanced features, enterprise support, and commercial licensing options not included in this open-source package.
 
 ## Development and Testing
 
+Aspose.Cells FOSS for .NET targets net8.0 and requires the .NET 8 SDK or a newer SDK capable of targeting net8.0. The main library and samples are built using the dotnet CLI. Build the main library: dotnet build src `Aspose.Cells_FOSS` `Aspose.Cells_FOSS.csproj` -c Debug. Build the basic sample: dotnet build samples `Aspose.Cells_FOSS.Samples.Basic` `Aspose.Cells_FOSS.Samples.Basic.csproj` -c Debug.
+
 Building from source requires the .NET 8 SDK or a newer SDK capable of targeting `net8.0`. The library and samples target `net8.0`.
-
-Build the main library:
 
 ```bash
 dotnet build src\Aspose.Cells_FOSS\Aspose.Cells_FOSS.csproj -c Debug
 ```
 
-Build the basic sample:
-
 ```bash
 dotnet build samples\Aspose.Cells_FOSS.Samples.Basic\Aspose.Cells_FOSS.Samples.Basic.csproj -c Debug
 ```
 
-This checkout does not contain a `tests/` directory. These builds check compilation; they do not provide automated behavioral test coverage.
